# Store and check out every text file with LF line endings, on every
# machine. The site is built on Linux (GitHub Actions) and files written
# by Claude Code use LF, so this stops Windows' core.autocrlf setting
# from warning "LF will be replaced by CRLF" or converting them.
# Binary files (images, PDFs) are auto-detected and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
